OL,3,AEd Sheeran admits 'mistakes' as he
OL,4,Aaddresses Macklemore controversy at
OL,5,APhiladelphia show
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe described the 7 October 2023 attacks
OL,8,Fas "horrific" and called the situation
OL,9,Fin Gaza "unjustifiable" in his first
OL,10,Fin-person remarks since the controversy
OL,11,Ferupted.
OL,13,FThe concert was a stripped-down event,
OL,14,Fand Sheeran performed without opening
OL,15,Facts.
